Band Description: A four-piece ensemble featuring two nonagenarian percussionists who play custom-built glass gongs and a rhythm section consisting of a slide guitarist and a bassist who plays through a gutted industrial air compressor. Their aesthetic is stark and utilitarian; they perform in total darkness, illuminated only by the flicker of the shival bells catching the dim light.

